{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_01",
      "hash": "d74771d1dcdd62f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：为了坂木老大，\\n大老远跑到紫苑镇来……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_02",
      "hash": "d74774d1dcdd680d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "结果哪里都找不到\\n那个叫富士的老头子！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0690_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "c6bc31c54cc29f90",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎：还没找的地方，\\n就只剩下宝可梦塔的最上头了吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_03",
      "hash": "d74773d1dcdd665a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：不过因为有奇怪的[VAR COLOR(0006)]幽灵[VAR COLOR(0000)]捣乱，\\n完全[VAR COLOR(0006)]没有办法到达上面[VAR COLOR(0000)]吧～"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0690_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "c6bc34c54cc2a4a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎：既然没找到那个老头子，\\c\\n不如把这只卡拉卡拉\\n掳走了带去基地交差吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_04",
      "hash": "d7476ed1dcdd5ddb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：好主意！那咱们就赶紧出发\\n前往[VAR COLOR(0006)]玉虹市[VAR COLOR(0000)]的[VAR COLOR(0006)]火箭游戏城[VAR COLOR(0000)]吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0690_karakara_01",
      "hash": "8ac4c1eac38e8eb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉：嘛～？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_08",
      "hash": "d7476ad1dcdd570f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：乖哦乖哦！\\n你的麻麻就在玉虹市喔～\\r\\n姐姐带你一起去吧～"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0690_karakara_02",
      "hash": "8ac4c4eac38e93d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉：嘛嘛～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0690_all_01",
      "hash": "afaa9eb286d542b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "既然这么决定了，\\n那咱们就赶快走吧～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_01",
      "hash": "9bacda0fa316a5ac",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这、这真是太糟糕了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_02",
      "hash": "9bacdd0fa316aac5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你看到没！？\\n火箭队把卡拉卡拉拐走了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_03",
      "hash": "9bacdc0fa316a912",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "他们好像是\\n要前往[VAR COLOR(0006)]玉虹市[VAR COLOR(0000)]来着……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_04",
      "hash": "9bacd70fa316a093",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "搞不好是为了\\n要把骨头高价出售呢……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_05",
      "hash": "9bacd60fa3169ee0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你从火箭队手里\\n救出了卡拉卡拉吗！？\\r\\n好厉害啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_06",
      "hash": "9bacd90fa316a3f9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这是我感谢的心意！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0690_system_01",
      "hash": "097ca861ce11115b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]得到了\\n20个超级球！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_07",
      "hash": "9bacd80fa316a246",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "如果能像你一样勇敢，\\c\\n不知道我是不是也能\\n面不改色地爬上宝可梦塔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_05",
      "hash": "d7476dd1dcdd5c28",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：那边！就是那边！\\n啊～～！明明就差一点点了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0690_kojiro_03",
      "hash": "c6bc33c54cc2a2f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎：我说，武藏啊～\\c\\n咱们差不多该回基地了吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_06",
      "hash": "d74770d1dcdd6141",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：嗯～有什么关系嘛～！\\c\\n反正已经把[VAR COLOR(0006)]卡拉卡拉[VAR COLOR(0000)]交给警卫了，\\n咱们休息一下也没什么吧！\\c\\n话说，[VAR COLOR(0006)]基地的暗门[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n是要怎么开的来着？"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0690_kojiro_04",
      "hash": "c6bc36c54cc2a80f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎：当然是要好好调查\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]交通工具[VAR COLOR(0000)]的[VAR COLOR(0006)]海报[VAR COLOR(0000)]那块地方啦！\\c\\n就是那张[VAR COLOR(0006)]和你我一样风格[VAR COLOR(0000)]的\\n帅气十足的[VAR COLOR(0006)]交通工具[VAR COLOR(0000)]的海报嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_07",
      "hash": "d7476fd1dcdd5f8e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏：和你我一样风格的\\n交通工具是什么东西啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main0690_kojiro_05",
      "hash": "c6bc35c54cc2a65c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎：这还用说吗？\\n当然是[VAR COLOR(0006)]穿梭在银河[VAR COLOR(0000)]……的那个啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main0690_nyasu_01",
      "hash": "299ff18c5c968898",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喵喵：呼喵～～"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0690_max",
      "hash": "2dbbf705c3cc63fc"
    }
  ]
}
